        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 462.84000000000003,
          "end": 465.84000000000003,
          "en": "when we created the table except for the id,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 465.84000000000003,
          "end": 468.423,
          "en": "because that will be populated automatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 470.19,
          "end": 473.55,
          "en": "Now we must specify the values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 473.55,
          "end": 476.37,
          "en": "that should be inserted into those fields.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 476.37,
          "end": 480.33,
          "en": "And here you could directly inject those values,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 480.33,
          "end": 482.04,
          "en": "but this is not recommended",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 482.04,
          "end": 484.17,
          "en": "because that approach would be vulnerable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 484.17,
          "end": 486.063,
          "en": "to SQL injection attacks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 487.05,
          "end": 489.84,
          "en": "Instead, you should use those placeholders",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 489.84,
          "end": 494.1,
          "en": "one for every field though to make this a bit easier,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 494.1,
          "end": 496.35,
          "en": "you can also use another syntax here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 496.35,
          "end": 498.69,
          "en": "supported by better-sqlite,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 498.69,
          "end": 503.493,
          "en": "which I also used in the initdb.js file, this syntax here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 504.72,
          "end": 509.403,
          "en": "You can target specific fields by their name, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 510.54,
          "end": 514.77,
          "en": "And then later just pass an object to the run function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 514.77,
          "end": 517.95,
          "en": "which we will call on this prepared statement",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 517.95,
          "end": 519.75,
          "en": "and better-sqlite.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 519.75,
          "end": 523.17,
          "en": "The package we're using to execute this command here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 523.17,
          "end": 525.66,
          "en": "will then look at those property names",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 525.66,
          "end": 527.97,
          "en": "in that object you're passing to it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 527.97,
          "end": 531.72,
          "en": "to extract the values stored under those property names",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 531.72,
          "end": 533.91,
          "en": "and it will then use those values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 533.91,
          "end": 535.713,
          "en": "to store them in those fields.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 537.48,
          "end": 540.57,
          "en": "However, you must make sure that the order you got here",
